// A JSON unicode space is a space before the rank.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE space ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG space law

IMPULSE space 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "space" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
